{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.4bb2dce2be0be28435bcf5ae.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The assessment concerns one offered benefit in a distributor’s promotion of SFC-authorised funds.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.4bb2dce2be0be28435bcf5ae.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"A genuine discount can be treated as excepted even where it otherwise falls within the assessed gift category.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.4bb2dce2be0be28435bcf5ae.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The product-specific context and anti-distraction purpose imply that excepted fees or charges must relate to the promoted product or product type.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.4bb2dce2be0be28435bcf5ae.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"This implied limitation is a provisional purposive reading, not an express condition in the retained wording.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.4bb2dce2be0be28435bcf5ae.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Unknown facts remain unknown; Boolean conclusions may nevertheless follow where a known fact makes an exception unavailable.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"7741380cce3666a2c2c3caa6477278144dc70ed4088e014c466278771c3b18a3","candidate_id":"candidate.77775fbae8c6437b9f91033c958d683e","controlled_language":"Selected control: paragraph-10 gift-promotion restriction with a product-related fee-discount exception. Within scope, an offered gift is caught unless it genuinely discounts fees or charges relating to the promoted product or product type. A true result concerns this restriction only.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["exceptions"],"generation_phase":"SHARED_RESOLUTION","issue_ids":[],"parent_id":"candidate.8aec15decfd64981833bb9e20562a266","probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"Narrows the exception to reductions in costs relating to the promoted product. An unrelated-servi